{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1000_044miz", "source_sha256": "5c90982c39e89cec3db46b067b465996b32da4948eab4a2b1a8abbf99608f146", "ja": "これがゲームをテーマにした衣装……\nとてもスタイリッシュです。それに、カッコいい。", "zh": "这就是以游戏为主题的服装……\n非常时尚。而且，很帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1001_p", "source_sha256": "2634077c775bcb3d02c68bf8d3cac2b12776d5f8338c8a3026f85ec5764fac69", "ja": "そうだな。\nスポーティーさもあって。うん、カッコいい。", "zh": "是啊。\n还带着运动风。嗯，真帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1002_044miz", "source_sha256": "15446865118b00cafa0d0dc17d591959f6bb0c1664cf06e51049d12c37f68bfa", "ja": "はい。まさに気分は、ゲームの世界から\n飛び出してきたキャラクター。名前はミズキ。", "zh": "是的。简直就像从游戏世界里跳出来的角色。名字叫瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "27b28a4dac564180b997c1137407a4215b2d6cbe95c5dfcbc64569b6929ec4e6", "ja": "突然ですが、{$P$}。\nプレイヤーになって、私を操作してみてください。", "zh": "虽然有点突然，{$P$}。\n请成为玩家，试着操作我吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5609a8afb0a9c943a52c41bd015e35a6aa217f4fbb0dda88e0084bacb0c5e46e", "ja": "……本当に突然だな。\n操作って言われても、どうしたらいいんだ？", "zh": "……还真是够突然的。\n就算你让我操作，我也该怎么做才好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "e24e92d2958655e55345077b448cdb86727dbd04cb09ec92b87fc7e3d5a1e84a", "ja": "確かに……。コントローラーはありませんので、\nエアーで。それか、言葉で指示を出してください。", "zh": "确实……。没有控制器，\n所以请用手势操作，或者用语言下达指令。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1ed1af0f32070df1c384292bca37d86e57818702ec0f1477f9b7e9705a0887ce", "ja": "ふむ、わかった。えーと……\n「反復横跳びしてほしい」、こんな感じか？", "zh": "嗯，明白了。呃……  \n“希望你做侧向交叉步”，是这种感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "5fd8be3d52233a7c2d726f47bd7939c37fb7dec671a42a0fdf068093348448d3", "ja": "わかりました。\n華麗なるステップをご覧ください。それでは……ごー。", "zh": "明白了。\n请欣赏华丽的舞步。那么……开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "3c13a70769a9932a5093b703cd767ed6e6384567ccc2c8200aabce3c727897b5", "ja": "ワン、ツー、スリー……あっ。\nワン、ツー……おっと。", "zh": "一、二、三……啊。\n一、二……哎呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f9b9f2c6eadf3227a0ae792a91397efb814c24e0f6791ac758b23434524eeb38", "ja": "だ、大丈夫か！？　ストップ、ストップだ！", "zh": "没、没事吧！？停下，快停下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "23cc717564367f7fd5269f96a5cddf89058b355140e10a007c91dece7b12a475", "ja": "ふぅ……。そういえば、行動を止めるにも、指示が\n必要だと説明していませんでしたね。うっかり。", "zh": "呼……说起来，我好像还没说明，就连让行动停下来也需要下达指令。真是粗心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1011_p", "source_sha256": "bd8fa42a74fb137952e6375f0efebc2f30ba967b38b41c6d50dbe543aa537889", "ja": "じゃあ、あそこで止めなかったら、反復横跳びを\n続けてたってことか……。迂闊なことは言えないな。", "zh": "那就是说，如果我没在那儿喊停，你就会一直做反复横跳了……。以后可不能随便下指示了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "0c4f227808e53fc7de0ad38c7ab30e53d4e8cf54790efae5073ed718fe19c931", "ja": "今ので体力がほとんどなくなってしまいました。\nアイテムか魔法で回復してください。……ふらふら。", "zh": "刚才那一下，我的体力几乎耗尽了。请用道具或魔法帮我恢复。……晕乎乎的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1013_p", "source_sha256": "ca195f129b406a6e4d0e8a8e214772ec35adb2b5221e989a331badbdf628462b", "ja": "そ、そうだよな！　すまなかった、瑞希。\nって、どうやって回復したらいいんだ？", "zh": "对、对啊！抱歉，瑞希。\n话说，我该怎么恢复啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1014_044miz", "source_sha256": "27c74e584e0fcbe0c9f5e321a4ffd109545bdb44caedbaf3adf25118fe43ce66", "ja": "ピコン、ピコン……甘いものが不足しています。\nこのままではゲームオーバーです。ピコン、ピコン。", "zh": "哔咚、哔咚……甜食不足。\n照这样下去就要游戏结束了。哔咚、哔咚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f1bafd3dc6b06c3ceff52383fbb89626e2709b4a1839d135187c38b840c0bfbe", "ja": "……なるほど、そういうことか。\nそれじゃ、試着が終わったらおやつタイムにしよう。", "zh": "……原来如此，是这么回事啊。\n那试穿结束后就来点心时间吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9b545edd44667c57e94d503c98825ace19b305011e8ac5faa5d5311da1c50b35", "ja": "俺もちょうど休憩しようと思ってたところなんだ。\nこれなら、瑞希の体力も回復するかな？", "zh": "我也正好打算休息一下。这样的话，瑞希的体力也能恢复吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1017_044miz", "source_sha256": "ee7f7eef4830616fa1d9dea6240bab204825cba67bb978ffc8f1ee0eefb8be8f", "ja": "はい、バッチリです。体力は全回復、\nこれでどんなステージでもクリアできます。", "zh": "是的，完全没问题。体力已经完全恢复了，\n这样一来，无论什么舞台都能顺利通关。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1018_p", "source_sha256": "3aaf5fe38b50eddfa515536f759bd2304a6bc08b4ad9aa4c23db3356dfae13d4", "ja": "ははっ、それはよかった。それじゃ、\nおやつの準備をしてくるから着替えて待っててくれ。", "zh": "哈哈，那太好了。那我去准备点心，你先换好衣服等着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "4863badd0ce7a595869d63b9bfdf57b768259b77bd43d508e32cd50730d052c6", "ja": "はい、わかりました。行ってらっしゃい。", "zh": "好的，我知道了。慢走。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_044miz0414_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_044miz0414_1020_044miz", "source_sha256": "eca3177126d5df95b2f883e9aa3cc4d5891e67a1118bdc4a9c745549a055a16f", "ja": "{$P$}は一流のプレイヤーですね。\n体力も好感度も大幅アップです。……ぎゅいーん。", "zh": "{$P$}真是一位一流的玩家呢。\n体力和好感度都大幅提升了。……咻——。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
